# Thread t of CTA c stores when t + 64·c < 1000. With no grid, %ctaid is
# unbounded and the mask an unknown selector: per CTA the store is a
# bound. Under 15 CTAs every thread of every CTA stores, so the guard
# holds, 3,840 B over the launch; under 16 the last CTA stores on its
# first 40 threads, so the store's sectors per request are a bound, and
# over the launch it is 1000 threads' 4000 B. Under the largest grid
# CUDA allows, 2^31-1 by 65535 by 65535 CTAs, a count over the launch
# leaves i64 and is unknown.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/cta_mask.ptx --bind 1:n=1000 | FileCheck --check-prefix=FREE "%s"
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/cta_mask.ptx --bind 1:n=1000 --grid 15 | FileCheck --check-prefix=FULL "%s"
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/cta_mask.ptx --bind 1:n=1000 --grid 16 | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANNPARTIAL "%s"
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/cta_mask.ptx --bind 1:n=1000 --grid 2147483647,65535,65535 | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANNHUGE "%s"
FREE: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_cta_mask( // block 64×1×1 | param_1 = 1000 | per CTA: global store <= 256 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
FREE: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // <= warp * × lane * | exec <= 64/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + 256·%ctaid.x + param_0] sectors/req <= 5 (ideal <= 4){{$}}
FULL: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_cta_mask( // grid 15×1×1 | block 64×1×1 | param_1 = 1000 | per launch: global store 3,840 B; param load 11,520 B{{$}}
FULL: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // global store [4·%tid.x + 256·%ctaid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4–5 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANNPARTIAL: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_cta_mask( // grid 16×1×1 | block 64×1×1 | param_1 = 1000 | per launch: global store 4,000 B; param load 12,288 B{{$}}
ANNPARTIAL: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // warp * × lane * in 15/16 CTAs, other 1 CTAs differ | exec 1,000/launch | global store [4·%tid.x + 256·%ctaid.x + param_0] sectors/req <= 5 (ideal <= 4){{$}}
ANNHUGE: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_cta_mask( // grid 2147483647×65535×65535 | block 64×1×1 | param_1 = 1000 | per launch: global store ? B; param load ? B{{$}}
